    "body": "## Summary\n\n**ADR-046 — logging infrastructure.** Three commits on one branch, merged after Commit 2's manual env-var verification.\n\n**Purely additive.** Zero existing debug prints in the project; every prior diagnostic session was add-prints → rebuild → remove-prints → rebuild. This ends that cycle with permanent, gated logging.\n\n## Commits\n\n| # | Scope | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **Infrastructure + 14 tests + `log_init()` in main** (behavior-neutral) | ✅ Green — 586 / 2263 tests pass |\n| 2 | **~15-20 `HB_LOG` log points** across 7 files | ⏳ Pending — manual env-var verification before merge |\n| 3 | **Docs** (README env-var section, CHANGELOG) | ⏳ Pending |\n\n## Commit 1 details\n\n### API surface\n\n```cpp\nenum class LogCategory { Pipeline, Css, Cascade, Layout, Paint, Fetch, Event };\nenum class LogLevel { Error, Warn, Info, Debug, Trace };\n\nvoid log_init() noexcept;           // called from main() once\nvoid log_set_config(...) noexcept;  // programmatic (tests)\nbool log_enabled(cat, lvl) noexcept; // hot path, 3 atomics\nvoid log_writev(cat, lvl, file, line, fmt, ...) noexcept;\n\n// Usage:\nHB_LOG(Layout, Debug, \"child_count=%d\", n);\n```\n\n**Zero cost when disabled**: single atomic bool read + branch. No formatting, no allocation, no mutex.\n\n### Env vars\n\n| Variable | Example | Default |\n|---|---|---|\n| `HONEYBEE_LOG` | `layout,paint,fetch` or `all` | (unset = disabled) |\n| `HONEYBEE_LOG_LEVEL` | `error|warn|info|debug|trace` | `debug` when set |\n| `HONEYBEE_LOG_FILE` | `/tmp/hb.log` | stderr |\n\n**Output format**:\n```\n[honeybee][layout][debug] src/renderer/layout/layout.cpp:482 child_count=3\n```\n\nPath trimmed at `/src/` prefix — greppable by category: `grep '\\[layout\\]'`.\n\n### What's tested (14 tests)\n\n- Disabled config → no output anywhere\n- Mask filters categories (Layout+Paint only → Css disabled)\n- Level threshold (Info excludes Debug/Trace)\n- Output format correct\n- Path trimming at `/src/` (and untouched for non-src)\n- **4-thread stress test**: 200 complete lines, zero interleaving (mutex works)\n- All 4 env var parse cases: no-env / `all` / explicit list / malformed\n- `HB_LOG` macro: no output when disabled, one line when enabled\n\n### Behavior-neutral guarantee\n\n`HONEYBEE_LOG` unset (default) → `log_init()` sets `enabled_ = false`. Every `HB_LOG` site is a single `log_enabled()` call returning false immediately. **Zero output change** for all existing workflows. Zero change in the 572 pre-existing tests.\n\n## Commit 2 preview (visible in stderr when enabled)\n\n~15-20 log points across 7 files:\n\n| File | Category | Sample |\n|---|---|---|\n| `main.cpp` | Pipeline | startup |\n| `render_pipeline.cpp` | Pipeline | cache hit/miss, cascade count, layout/paint |\n| `async_fetcher.cpp` | Fetch | fetch start/end, response size |\n| `cascade.cpp` | Cascade | rules matched |\n| `layout.cpp` | Layout | element count, dispatch mode |\n| `paint.cpp` | Paint | box count, image count |\n| `net/client.cpp` | Fetch | HTTP URLs, status codes |\n\nVerified manually across 6 env-var combos (see ADR-046 Verification section).\n\n## Deferred (per ADR-046)\n\n- `std::format` migration (future ADR-047)\n- Runtime config reload\n- Log rotation (external `logrotate`)\n- Structured (JSON) output\n- Per-category thresholds\n- Trace-level perf timing\n\n## Test count\n\n- Before ADR-046: 572 cases / 2224 assertions\n- After Commit 1: **586 cases / 2263 assertions** (+14 / +39)\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n\n- [ ] **Zero-cost when disabled** — disabled path is one atomic bool read + branch. Verified via test 1 and 14.\n- [ ] **Thread-safe** — mutex held around `fprintf` + `vfprintf` + `fputc('\\n')`. Verified via 4-thread stress test (200 complete lines, zero interleaving).\n- [ ] **`log_set_config` for tests** — env vars leak via `setenv`/`unsetenv`; programmatic API gives full isolation. `tmpfile()` for output capture.\n- [ ] **Path trimming** — `/home/user/src/renderer/...` → `src/renderer/...`. Non-src paths unchanged.\n- [ ] **Behavior-neutral** — `HONEYBEE_LOG` unset = zero output change. Zero change in 572 pre-existing tests.\n\n## DO NOT MERGE until Commit 2's manual env-var verification passes.\n\nRefs #221\n",
